    "selection": "Four complete published house files, selected before power inspection: development houses 3/5, heldout 2/11. Distinct physical households; only washing machine and dishwasher channels.",
    "extraction": "10 W threshold / 15-minute within-program gaps; sensitivity 5/20 W and 5/30-minute gaps. Discard censored, >120-second-gap, <98% observed duration or implausible cycles. Integrate measured W with observed intervals, cap held samples at 16 seconds. Preserve the Issues fraction (sum of IAMs exceeding aggregate; not a per-channel failure) for separate quality sensitivity, rather than discarding a whole multi-hour cycle for one flagged row. Retain aggregate cycle/day summaries, not raw CSV copies.",
    "limits": "UK 2013-2015 appliances, not 2024 Portuguese equipment. Cleaned REFIT filled short gaps and zeroed long gaps upstream; unflagged zero gaps cannot be recovered. Detected candidates are not ground-truth program labels or measured user deadlines."
  },
